    [Doc][Misc] Update Qwen 27B tutorials with optimized system settings and new vLLM parameters (#19612)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the deployment tutorials for Qwen3.5-27B, Qwen3.6-27B,
    and Qwen3.8-27B models on Ascend NPUs. It introduces recommended
    system-level tuning configurations (`sysctl` settings) to optimize
    memory and scheduling, updates model execution parameters to align with
    vLLM v1 defaults (such as enabling prefix caching by default), and adds
    documentation for new multimodal and performance optimization flags
    (e.g., `--allowed-local-media-path`, `--mm-processor-cache-gb`,
    `enable_flashcomm1`). It also corrects the benchmarking commands to use
    the updated `vllm bench serve` options.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation changes only, verified by reviewing the parameter
    consistency with the codebase and testing configurations.
    
